WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.120
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.390 --> 01:34.910
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.350 --> 01:37.820
[Episode 23]

4
01:53.950 --> 01:54.780
Chairman Mao.

5
01:55.440 --> 01:56.330
Be careful.

6
01:57.070 --> 01:58.110
I'm here to see you off.

7
01:58.110 --> 01:58.860
Thank you, Chairman.

8
01:58.860 --> 02:00.060
Thank you, Chairman.

9
02:12.630 --> 02:13.560
Comrades!

10
02:13.800 --> 02:16.400
Chairman Mao is here to see us off!

11
02:16.650 --> 02:17.650
Attention!

12
02:20.880 --> 02:22.610
Comrades of the 13th Regiment!

13
02:23.240 --> 02:24.280
I know you.

14
02:25.430 --> 02:27.570
Your predecessor was the 5th Red Division.

15
02:27.570 --> 02:28.800
In September 1933,

16
02:29.710 --> 02:31.800
in the Qinshan encounter in Fujian,

17
02:33.400 --> 02:35.130
you defeated the Kuomintang's

18
02:35.150 --> 02:37.560
366th Regiment, known as the "Iron Army,"

19
02:37.670 --> 02:41.390
[Peng Xuefeng, Regiment Commander of the 13th Regiment of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

20
02:38.150 --> 02:39.920
and became famous in one battle!

21
02:39.920 --> 02:41.750
On the eve of the strategic shift,

22
02:41.750 --> 02:43.840
you were ordered to guard Gaohunao.

23
02:44.520 --> 02:47.030
Using only bayonets,

24
02:47.130 --> 02:50.530
[Li Ganhui, Political Commissar of the 13th Regiment of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

25
02:47.360 --> 02:50.760
you repelled multiple charges by the Kuomintang army,

26
02:51.150 --> 02:53.780
gaining time for the strategic shift.

27
02:54.840 --> 02:56.030
Just two months ago,

28
02:56.470 --> 02:58.070
in the Battle of Xiang River,

29
02:58.470 --> 03:00.000
to cover the Central Column

30
03:00.590 --> 03:02.780
and the Military Commission Column crossing the river,

31
03:02.780 --> 03:04.310
you held Xinxu at all costs.

32
03:04.790 --> 03:06.830
At the cost of 2,000 casualties,

33
03:08.110 --> 03:10.170
you completed the blocking mission.

34
03:10.830 --> 03:13.090
The troops were almost completely lost.

35
03:14.910 --> 03:16.840
But the flag of the 5th Red Division

36
03:18.190 --> 03:19.840
never fell!

37
03:20.560 --> 03:21.930
It never fell!

38
03:23.470 --> 03:25.070
I asked Comrade Peng Dehuai,

39
03:25.400 --> 03:26.840
why make a unit

40
03:26.840 --> 03:28.640
that excels in blocking battles

41
03:30.180 --> 03:32.310
the vanguard regiment for an assault?

42
03:32.910 --> 03:34.040
Peng Dehuai told me,

43
03:34.360 --> 03:37.360
it's precisely because you excel in blocking battles

44
03:37.520 --> 03:39.030
that you can spot

45
03:39.400 --> 03:42.260
the loopholes in the enemy's positions at a glance!

46
03:43.050 --> 03:44.450
Peng Dehuai also told me,

47
03:45.079 --> 03:46.310
for the 3rd Red Army Corps,

48
03:46.310 --> 03:47.910
there is no such thing as excelling in blocking

49
03:47.910 --> 03:49.370
or excelling in assaults.

50
03:49.470 --> 03:50.470
If anything,

51
03:50.800 --> 03:52.530
it's that the 3rd Red Army Corps

52
03:52.710 --> 03:54.910
excels in fighting bitter battles

53
03:55.520 --> 03:57.520
and tough battles!

54
03:58.280 --> 03:59.280
Loushanguan

55
03:59.640 --> 04:00.700
is a bitter battle,

56
04:01.910 --> 04:02.880
a tough battle.

57
04:04.120 --> 04:06.430
I await the news of your triumphant return!

58
04:06.430 --> 04:08.030
We'll carry out the mission!

59
04:08.280 --> 04:09.880
We'll carry out the mission!

60
04:09.910 --> 04:11.750
We'll carry out the mission!

61
04:12.630 --> 04:13.520
We'll carry out the mission!

62
04:13.520 --> 04:15.120
We'll carry out the mission!

63
04:17.269 --> 04:18.070
Comrades!

64
04:18.510 --> 04:19.360
Move out!

65
04:19.930 --> 04:21.000
Attention all!

66
04:21.269 --> 04:22.600
Right face!

67
04:24.430 --> 04:25.840
Double time, march!

68
06:28.610 --> 06:29.320
Yes!

69
06:29.570 --> 06:30.300
Yes!

70
06:35.490 --> 06:36.290
Xuefeng.

71
06:36.480 --> 06:39.040
The Corps Commander wants to know how our attack is going.

72
06:39.040 --> 06:41.170
He... he's already cursing up a storm!

73
06:47.070 --> 06:48.560
Give me a little more time.

74
06:48.950 --> 06:51.350
I'll personally lead the commando team up.

75
06:51.390 --> 06:53.000
If we can't take Loushanguan,

76
06:53.000 --> 06:55.330
I'll bring my head to the Corps Commander!

77
06:59.040 --> 06:59.640
Shangkun.

78
07:00.630 --> 07:02.160
The fighting is in a stalemate.

79
07:02.160 --> 07:03.120
Yes.

80
07:12.190 --> 07:12.870
Peng!

81
07:13.160 --> 07:14.000
Peng.

82
07:14.980 --> 07:16.230
Peng Xuefeng said he will personally lead

83
07:16.230 --> 07:17.430
a dare-to-die squad to charge.

84
07:17.430 --> 07:18.360
If he can't take the position,

85
07:18.360 --> 07:19.890
he'll bring his head to you.

86
07:20.190 --> 07:21.250
Tell Peng Xuefeng,

87
07:21.480 --> 07:22.610
my 3rd Red Army Corps

88
07:22.720 --> 07:24.430
doesn't lack a dare-to-die squad leader like him.

89
07:24.430 --> 07:26.230
If they can't take Loushanguan,

90
07:26.630 --> 07:27.630
pull them back.

91
07:28.000 --> 07:29.000
The 12th Regiment is waiting.

92
07:29.000 --> 07:29.560
Okay.

93
07:31.630 --> 07:33.560
With Peng Xuefeng's fiery temper,

94
07:34.120 --> 07:35.630
only you can keep him under control.

95
07:35.630 --> 07:36.720
That stubborn boy.

96
07:36.970 --> 07:39.780
[Yang Shangkun, Political Commissar of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

97
07:37.680 --> 07:38.940
It's strange, though.

98
07:39.150 --> 07:41.550
Why is the Guizhou Army suddenly so fierce?

99
07:41.630 --> 07:42.490
They are fierce

100
07:43.120 --> 07:44.360
firstly because they have nowhere to retreat,

101
07:44.360 --> 07:45.159
and secondly,

102
07:45.750 --> 07:47.480
they have something to rely on.

103
07:48.270 --> 07:51.430
They are waiting for reinforcements from the Central Army.

104
07:51.430 --> 07:52.310
Exactly.

105
07:52.720 --> 07:55.040
The terrain of Loushanguan is too complex.

106
07:55.040 --> 07:56.390
The enemy has the high ground,

107
07:56.390 --> 07:58.040
and our troops can't deploy.

108
08:01.870 --> 08:03.120
Dianjinshan Heights.

109
08:03.120 --> 08:04.760
If we take Dianjinshan Heights,

110
08:04.760 --> 08:07.320
we will have the high ground.

111
08:07.630 --> 08:09.030
Dianjinshan Heights...

112
08:09.070 --> 08:10.730
The troops scouted it before.

113
08:11.000 --> 08:13.310
The enemy doesn't have many troops there.

114
08:13.310 --> 08:14.510
But the terrain of Dianjinshan Heights

115
08:14.510 --> 08:15.720
is extremely steep.

116
08:19.390 --> 08:21.720
It depends on whether the soldiers of the 13th Regiment

117
08:21.720 --> 08:23.720
have the determination to climb up.

118
08:24.310 --> 08:25.440
Trust those you use.

119
08:25.720 --> 08:27.720
I will personally give the order

120
08:28.430 --> 08:30.090
to Peng Xuefeng and Li Ganhui.

121
08:30.310 --> 08:31.040
Take it.

122
08:32.870 --> 08:33.530
Here you go.

123
08:53.870 --> 08:54.720
Come.

124
08:55.910 --> 08:57.040
Company Commander,

125
08:57.120 --> 08:59.160
you have a big appetite, take a few more.

126
08:59.160 --> 09:00.970
[Guo Shanlin, Cooking squad Leader of a Company of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

127
08:59.270 --> 09:01.600
Guo, why are you still calling me Company Commander?

128
09:01.600 --> 09:02.870
I'm a Squad Leader now.

129
09:03.870 --> 09:04.790
I'm used to it.

130
09:05.960 --> 09:08.150
After we win the battle and expand the Red Army,

131
09:08.150 --> 09:10.600
won't you be a Company Commander again?

132
09:11.800 --> 09:12.790
I hope so.

133
09:13.150 --> 09:14.200
I'm doing fine here.

134
09:14.200 --> 09:16.360
I heard that at the 10th Regiment headquarters,

135
09:16.360 --> 09:17.600
ten Company Commanders

136
09:17.600 --> 09:19.330
formed a Communication Squad.

137
09:19.480 --> 09:20.000
Really?

138
09:22.150 --> 09:23.000
Comrades!

139
09:23.600 --> 09:24.450
Are you ready?

140
09:24.560 --> 09:25.280
Ready!

141
09:25.630 --> 09:26.480
Move out!

142
09:30.200 --> 09:31.150
Run!

143
09:33.670 --> 09:34.800
Company Commander,

144
09:35.030 --> 09:36.000
take a few more.

145
09:36.390 --> 09:37.080
No need.

146
09:37.270 --> 09:38.360
We're going up the mountain soon.

147
09:38.360 --> 09:40.020
Carrying too much is a burden.

148
09:40.960 --> 09:42.290
We're heading out, Guo.

149
09:44.150 --> 09:45.280
Then come back and eat.

150
09:45.280 --> 09:46.720
There's plenty when you come back!

151
09:46.720 --> 09:48.150
Who wants to eat this stuff?

152
09:48.150 --> 09:51.120
We're going to Zunyi to eat mutton soup noodles!

153
09:51.440 --> 09:52.560
Run!

154
09:54.720 --> 09:56.550
A Company Commander becoming a Squad Leader,

155
09:56.550 --> 09:57.600
what a pity.

156
09:59.140 --> 10:00.100
What's a pity?

157
10:01.010 --> 10:03.670
Our Red Army obeys orders and follows commands.

158
10:04.120 --> 10:05.120
Yes.

159
10:06.510 --> 10:07.270
Guo,

160
10:07.670 --> 10:08.730
it's good to be you.

161
10:09.150 --> 10:10.950
You'll always be a Squad Leader.

162
10:12.930 --> 10:13.690
Of course.

163
11:08.030 --> 11:08.790
Go up.

164
14:02.920 --> 14:03.810
They're up.

165
14:43.800 --> 14:45.580
They're up! They're up!

166
14:45.960 --> 14:47.620
Dianjinshan Heights is ours!

167
14:48.710 --> 14:49.360
Bugler!

168
14:49.800 --> 14:51.280
Sound the charge!

169
16:15.480 --> 16:16.740
They're all gathered.

170
16:17.260 --> 16:17.990
Good.

171
16:20.550 --> 16:21.970
The Guizhou Army's defense forces

172
16:21.970 --> 16:22.910
have all gathered at

173
16:22.910 --> 16:25.240
the frontal position of the Heishenmiao.

174
16:26.200 --> 16:27.240
It's time.

175
16:27.960 --> 16:28.600
Deng Ping,

176
16:28.910 --> 16:30.840
order the 12th Regiment to replace the 13th Regiment

177
16:30.840 --> 16:32.700
and continue the frontal attack.

178
16:33.320 --> 16:35.320
After the 13th Regiment withdraws,

179
16:35.670 --> 16:37.870
they will flank from the left and right with the 10th Regiment

180
16:37.870 --> 16:39.360
to annihilate the enemy at the Heishenmiao.

181
16:39.360 --> 16:40.750
Then order the 11th Regiment

182
16:40.750 --> 16:42.870
to raid Banqiao Town from the left side of the pass,

183
16:42.870 --> 16:45.080
completely cutting off the Guizhou Army's retreat!

184
16:45.080 --> 16:45.790
Great.

185
16:46.240 --> 16:47.390
That's how we'll fight.

186
16:47.390 --> 16:48.120
Deng Ping,

187
16:48.870 --> 16:49.840
tell the soldiers

188
16:49.840 --> 16:50.550
that in this battle,

189
16:50.550 --> 16:52.680
they must show the prestige of the Red Army!

190
16:52.680 --> 16:54.370
And with this prestige,

191
16:54.400 --> 16:55.550
we will retake Zunyi City!

192
16:55.550 --> 16:56.030
Yes!

193
17:00.150 --> 17:00.840
This place...

194
17:00.840 --> 17:01.790
The 11th Regiment

195
17:01.790 --> 17:03.120
will gather on the left side of the pass

196
17:03.120 --> 17:04.250
and wait for orders.

197
17:04.599 --> 17:05.510
Good.

198
17:22.550 --> 17:23.550
Comrades!

199
17:23.760 --> 17:26.060
[Zhong Chibing, Political Commissar of the 12th Regiment of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

200
17:24.030 --> 17:26.550
When the brave meet on a desperate path, the bold win.

201
17:26.550 --> 17:28.440
Show the prestige of our Red Army!

202
17:29.590 --> 17:31.000
Kill!

203
17:44.110 --> 17:45.680
Kill!

204
17:48.880 --> 17:49.480
Machine guns!

205
17:49.480 --> 17:50.790
Stop the Communist army!

206
17:50.790 --> 17:51.590
Yes!

207
17:54.510 --> 17:55.440
Kill!

208
18:01.580 --> 18:02.840
Political Commissar!

209
18:03.030 --> 18:05.120
You're injured, Political Commissar!

210
18:05.120 --> 18:06.490
I'm fine. It's nothing.

211
18:26.000 --> 18:27.160
Political Commissar!

212
18:27.160 --> 18:28.350
The 3rd Battalion is here,

213
18:28.350 --> 18:29.880
and the Cadre Regiment too!

214
18:30.510 --> 18:32.960
Comrades, don't stop!

215
18:33.230 --> 18:35.030
Get in close with the enemy!

216
18:35.630 --> 18:36.390
Kill!

217
18:44.880 --> 18:47.440
On February 25, 1935,

218
18:47.780 --> 18:50.270
the Central Red Army, after fierce fighting,

219
18:50.270 --> 18:53.400
recaptured the strategic fortress of Loushanguan.

220
18:54.290 --> 18:58.930
[The 12th Regiment of the 3rd Army Corps of the Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

221
23:16.350 --> 23:17.310
This time,

222
23:17.640 --> 23:18.510
we wiped out

223
23:19.510 --> 23:22.240
four Regiments of the Guizhou Army in one breath.

224
23:23.330 --> 23:25.730
Since the strategic shift five months ago,

225
23:25.900 --> 23:28.560
this is the first major victory we've achieved.

226
23:32.790 --> 23:33.590
Enlai,

227
23:36.680 --> 23:37.940
Commander-in-Chief,

228
23:40.140 --> 23:41.550
we made it through.

229
24:09.770 --> 24:10.840
Look.

230
24:12.200 --> 24:14.000
The rolling hills are like a sea.

231
24:14.380 --> 24:16.040
The setting sun is like blood.

232
24:23.770 --> 24:25.600
This is a good start.

233
24:32.200 --> 24:33.680
Our strategic shift

234
24:34.600 --> 24:36.730
has already turned into an expedition

235
24:37.110 --> 24:39.040
in the course of breaking through.

236
24:41.470 --> 24:43.000
This is just the beginning.

237
25:30.590 --> 25:31.920
Fierce is the west wind;

238
25:33.220 --> 25:36.790
Wild geese cry under the frosty morning moon.

239
25:38.480 --> 25:40.210
Under the frosty morning moon,

240
25:40.920 --> 25:42.680
Horses' hooves clattering,

241
25:43.480 --> 25:45.400
Bugles sobbing low.

242
25:47.550 --> 25:51.070
Idle boast the strong pass is a wall of iron;

243
25:52.860 --> 25:56.580
With firm strides we are crossing its summit.

244
25:58.000 --> 25:59.240
Crossing its summit!

245
26:00.770 --> 26:02.570
The rolling hills are like a sea,

246
26:03.450 --> 26:06.130
The setting sun is like blood!

247
26:49.720 --> 26:52.130
On February 26, 1935,

248
26:53.070 --> 26:55.160
the 1st and 3rd Corps of the Central Red Army,

249
26:55.160 --> 26:57.430
under orders from the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

250
26:57.430 --> 26:59.110
closely pursued the fleeing Guizhou Army

251
26:59.110 --> 27:02.030
and launched a surprise attack on Zunyi.

252
27:02.590 --> 27:03.880
They successively broke through the Guizhou Army's

253
27:03.880 --> 27:05.880
two defense lines set up at

254
27:05.880 --> 27:07.480
Donggongsi and Shizipu,

255
27:08.110 --> 27:10.030
and at 3 p.m. on the 27th,

256
27:10.240 --> 27:12.720
launched an attack on the new city of Zunyi.

257
27:45.890 --> 27:46.400
Report!

258
27:46.580 --> 27:49.240
Urgent telegram from Commander-in-Chief Xue.

259
27:50.080 --> 27:52.940
[Wu Qiwei, Commander of the 1st Column, 2nd Route Army of the KMT Troops' Pursuit Army]

260
27:54.160 --> 27:55.290
Good-for-nothing!

261
27:59.510 --> 28:01.110
The new city of Zunyi is lost.

262
28:01.960 --> 28:03.350
Before leaving Guiyang,

263
28:03.350 --> 28:05.150
the Commander-in-Chief told me

264
28:05.590 --> 28:08.640
that even if Wang Jialie's troops were a bunch of good-for-nothings,

265
28:08.440 --> 28:12.620
[Han Hanying, Commander of the 59th Division of the 1st Column, 2nd Route Army of the KMT Troops' Pursuit Army]

266
28:09.550 --> 28:11.400
they could still hold Loushanguan

267
28:11.400 --> 28:13.070
for eight to ten days.

268
28:13.960 --> 28:16.020
But in less than three days,

269
28:16.680 --> 28:19.280
they let the Communist army take half of Zunyi!

270
28:19.680 --> 28:20.610
What do we do now?

271
28:20.790 --> 28:22.320
Are we still going to Zunyi?

272
28:22.510 --> 28:25.270
The Generalissimo's handwritten order has already arrived in Guiyang.

273
28:25.270 --> 28:26.310
Zunyi is lost.

274
28:26.750 --> 28:29.150
The one to take the blame is not Wang Jialie,

275
28:29.240 --> 28:30.720
but Commander-in-Chief Xue,

276
28:30.720 --> 28:32.070
and us.

277
28:32.350 --> 28:33.790
Even if we march overnight,

278
28:33.790 --> 28:34.590
at this speed,

279
28:34.640 --> 28:36.310
we won't reach Zunyi until tomorrow.

280
28:36.310 --> 28:38.310
Can Wang Jialie hold out until then?

281
28:40.750 --> 28:42.960
Since the Communist army crossed the Chishui River eastward,

282
28:42.960 --> 28:45.690
they have been marching and fighting all the way.

283
28:46.070 --> 28:47.870
Having just taken Loushanguan,

284
28:48.160 --> 28:50.110
they must be extremely exhausted.

285
28:50.680 --> 28:53.200
Besides, the men of my 1st Column,

286
28:53.920 --> 28:56.680
their combat effectiveness is beyond what the Guizhou Army can compare to.

287
28:56.680 --> 28:58.540
Even if the whole of Zunyi is lost,

288
28:58.720 --> 29:00.120
I only need two Regiments

289
29:00.620 --> 29:02.010
to take it back.

290
29:03.150 --> 29:04.610
Rest assured, Commander!

291
29:04.880 --> 29:06.340
The men of my 59th Division

292
29:06.790 --> 29:09.190
are ready to follow your orders at any time!

293
29:10.550 --> 29:11.180
Staff Officer Liu.

294
29:11.180 --> 29:11.660
Here!

295
29:12.110 --> 29:13.740
Send an urgent telegram to Tang Yunshan.

296
29:13.740 --> 29:16.200
Tell their 93rd Division to catch up quickly

297
29:16.400 --> 29:17.940
and advance towards Zunyi at full speed.

298
29:17.940 --> 29:18.540
Yes!

299
29:22.750 --> 29:23.600
Speed up the advance.

300
29:23.600 --> 29:25.230
Speed up the advance!

301
29:32.240 --> 29:34.830
According to the enemy's current marching speed,

302
29:34.830 --> 29:36.160
Xue Yue's two Divisions

303
29:36.440 --> 29:39.300
will reach Zunyi tomorrow morning at the earliest.

304
29:39.380 --> 29:40.140
Bocheng,

305
29:40.480 --> 29:41.500
inform the 1st and 3rd Corps

306
29:41.500 --> 29:43.030
of the situation as soon as possible.

307
29:43.030 --> 29:44.030
Emphasize to them

308
29:44.240 --> 29:46.510
that it's time to turn the tide of the battle again.

309
29:46.510 --> 29:47.310
Tonight,

310
29:47.640 --> 29:49.640
the outcome of their attack on Zunyi

311
29:49.750 --> 29:51.570
will determine the fate of the Central Red Army.

312
29:51.570 --> 29:52.300
Understood.

313
29:52.890 --> 29:53.810
Wait a minute.

314
29:55.160 --> 29:55.790
Chairman.

315
29:57.240 --> 29:58.640
The order must emphasize

316
29:58.640 --> 30:00.530
that not only must they capture the old city of Zunyi

317
30:00.530 --> 30:01.530
before dawn,

318
30:01.880 --> 30:03.960
but they must also immediately use the main force

319
30:03.960 --> 30:05.350
to control the commanding heights south of Zunyi,

320
30:05.350 --> 30:07.720
such as Laoyashan and Honghuagang,

321
30:08.000 --> 30:09.530
build blocking positions,

322
30:09.920 --> 30:11.830
and prepare to annihilate the Central Army's 93rd

323
30:11.830 --> 30:14.440
and 59th Divisions outside Zunyi,

324
30:14.620 --> 30:16.150
north of the Wujiang River.

325
30:16.590 --> 30:17.250
Old friend.

326
30:17.350 --> 30:18.200
It seems your appetite

327
30:18.200 --> 30:20.530
is not just for Wang Jialie and Zunyi City.

328
30:20.960 --> 30:23.200
In Records of the Grand Historian, Sun Bin said

329
30:23.200 --> 30:25.870
"A good commander takes advantage of the situation and guides it in his favor."

330
30:25.870 --> 30:27.310
After crossing the Chishui River for the second time,

331
30:27.310 --> 30:29.590
we raided Tongzi and captured Loushanguan.

332
30:29.590 --> 30:30.700
Taking Zunyi City again

333
30:30.700 --> 30:33.030
is the momentum we created by returning to northern Guizhou.

334
30:33.030 --> 30:34.640
The current situation is in our favor.

335
30:34.640 --> 30:36.170
The ultimate result we want

336
30:36.270 --> 30:38.270
is to annihilate Wu Qiwei's troops.

337
30:38.400 --> 30:40.640
The terrain of Laoyashan and Honghuagang

338
30:40.640 --> 30:41.700
is favorable to us.

339
30:41.900 --> 30:43.560
From a tactical perspective,

340
30:44.000 --> 30:46.200
if we can occupy Zunyi before the enemy,

341
30:46.550 --> 30:47.890
take the favorable terrain,

342
30:47.890 --> 30:49.720
and catch the Central Army off guard,

343
30:49.720 --> 30:51.580
we have all the conditions to win.

344
30:51.680 --> 30:53.830
I agree with Comrade Zedong's opinion.

345
30:53.830 --> 30:55.230
If we can win this battle,

346
30:55.440 --> 30:56.880
the situation in northern Guizhou

347
30:56.880 --> 30:58.680
will definitely be very different.

348
30:58.680 --> 30:59.500
Then we will issue orders

349
30:59.500 --> 31:01.070
to the First and Third Corps accordingly.

350
31:01.070 --> 31:02.750
The Commander-in-Chief of the campaign

351
31:02.750 --> 31:05.210
will still be Peng Dehuai and Yang Shangkun.

352
31:11.140 --> 31:14.240
[Temporary Command Post of the 3rd Red Army Corps, outside the old city of Zunyi, Guizhou]

353
31:11.590 --> 31:13.050
Look at this Zhang Aiping.

354
31:13.110 --> 31:14.800
He is acting soft today!

355
31:15.090 --> 31:15.890
He still hasn't taken down

356
31:15.890 --> 31:17.550
the old city of Zunyi after so long!

357
31:17.550 --> 31:19.480
We all know Zhang Aiping's temper.

358
31:20.300 --> 31:22.130
It looks like there are considerable difficulties.

359
31:22.130 --> 31:23.170
Let's wait a bit longer.

360
31:23.170 --> 31:24.650
We have a good dish today!

361
31:25.850 --> 31:27.180
Let me see what you made.

362
31:30.240 --> 31:31.920
It's one of Zunyi's Eight Great Bowls,

363
31:31.920 --> 31:33.200
Steamed Pork with Preserved Mustard Greens.

364
31:33.200 --> 31:34.600
It's left over from what we got in Zunyi last time.

365
31:34.600 --> 31:36.420
Only a bit is left, and I can't bear to eat it.

366
31:36.420 --> 31:37.440
Today I cooked it all

367
31:37.440 --> 31:38.770
to give you two a treat.

368
31:39.740 --> 31:40.400
Report!

369
31:43.540 --> 31:44.340
Report!

370
31:45.950 --> 31:46.960
Urgent telegram from the Military Commission.

371
31:46.960 --> 31:47.400
Good.

372
31:59.480 --> 32:00.510
Great.

373
32:01.790 --> 32:03.310
The Military Commission has courage.

374
32:03.310 --> 32:04.850
Not only do they want to take Zunyi City,

375
32:04.850 --> 32:07.550
but they also want to wipe out Wu Qiwei's two Divisions.

376
32:07.550 --> 32:09.150
This is a satisfying battle!

377
32:11.240 --> 32:12.350
Mao is back.

378
32:12.790 --> 32:14.510
Things are just different now.

379
32:14.510 --> 32:15.910
Then our primary task now

380
32:16.110 --> 32:17.350
is to take the old city of Zunyi

381
32:17.350 --> 32:18.680
as quickly as possible.

382
32:21.960 --> 32:23.890
I'll go check on the 11th Regiment.

383
32:30.030 --> 32:31.070
The dish is cooking in the pot.

384
32:31.070 --> 32:32.210
I've counted them all.

385
32:32.210 --> 32:34.590
There are exactly five slices of meat in here.

386
32:34.590 --> 32:36.590
No sneaking a bite before I get back.

387
32:36.590 --> 32:37.390
So bossy.

388
32:39.110 --> 32:40.840
I'll catch a duck for you later!

389
32:42.660 --> 32:44.990
Unreasonable comrades love eating duck.

390
32:46.120 --> 32:46.770
Peng.

391
32:47.550 --> 32:48.410
You're joking?

392
32:51.350 --> 32:53.550
Wait till I get back. No sneaking a bite!

393
32:54.070 --> 32:55.000
Silly boy.

394
32:55.360 --> 32:56.290
He didn't get it.

395
32:58.740 --> 32:59.610
He didn't get it.

396
32:59.610 --> 33:01.010
I was talking about Li De.

397
33:05.720 --> 33:06.770
Not funny?

398
33:09.020 --> 33:10.070
Show... show me

399
33:10.090 --> 33:12.350
where the 1st Red Army Corps has reached.

400
33:15.960 --> 33:21.970
[Old city of Zunyi, Guizhou]

401
33:50.690 --> 33:53.020
[Zhang Aiping, Political Commissar of the 12th Regiment of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

402
33:51.830 --> 33:52.830
We almost made it.

403
33:58.290 --> 34:00.080
Yes, sneak up from the side.

404
34:00.350 --> 34:00.980
Be careful.

405
34:00.980 --> 34:02.310
See if there's a chance.

406
34:02.460 --> 34:03.310
Okay.

407
34:05.690 --> 34:07.240
Leader, let's eat.

408
34:07.440 --> 34:08.110
Wait.

409
34:08.179 --> 34:09.480
Wait for the Chief of Staff to come back.

410
34:09.480 --> 34:10.409
But this dish...

411
34:10.510 --> 34:11.710
You guys go eat first.

412
34:34.239 --> 34:35.969
Zhang Aiping! Zhang Aiping!

413
34:36.400 --> 34:37.030
Chief of Staff.

414
34:37.030 --> 34:38.000
Why are you here?

415
34:38.400 --> 34:39.800
We can't fight like this.

416
34:39.850 --> 34:41.770
Hurry, stop the attack first.

417
34:43.550 --> 34:44.590
Cease fire!

418
34:45.230 --> 34:46.280
Cease fire!

419
34:48.550 --> 34:50.280
The enemy's crossfire is too fierce.

420
34:50.280 --> 34:51.150
If we keep fighting,

421
34:51.150 --> 34:52.610
it will become piecemeal reinforcement.

422
34:52.610 --> 34:53.630
I don't want to fight like this either.

423
34:53.630 --> 34:54.630
But time is tight.

424
34:55.150 --> 34:57.860
These Guizhou Army soldiers have smoked enough opium.

425
34:57.860 --> 35:00.260
They are holding on with their last breath.

426
35:24.670 --> 35:26.070
Then find their weak spot

427
35:27.380 --> 35:28.750
and strike hard.

428
35:30.880 --> 35:31.740
Chief of Staff!

429
35:32.000 --> 35:32.730
Chief of Staff!

430
35:32.730 --> 35:34.260
Be careful, Chief of Staff!

431
35:36.380 --> 35:38.240
Leader, we can't heat it anymore.

432
35:38.240 --> 35:40.360
If we heat it again, the meat will fall apart.

433
35:40.360 --> 35:42.070
Then just dish it out.

434
35:42.760 --> 35:43.550
But...

435
35:43.570 --> 35:44.520
Dish it out.

436
35:51.660 --> 35:52.610
Hello?

437
35:54.030 --> 35:55.030
Speak.

438
35:57.440 --> 35:58.400
What?

439
35:59.840 --> 36:01.370
Zhang Aiping, say it again.

440
36:09.050 --> 36:10.090
Peng!

441
36:17.770 --> 36:18.970
Comrade Deng Ping...

442
36:20.890 --> 36:21.950
has given his life.

443
36:48.550 --> 36:50.210
There is no war without death.

444
36:50.880 --> 36:51.710
Zhang Aiping.

445
36:52.150 --> 36:53.810
I want you to tell the comrades

446
36:53.920 --> 36:55.360
to watch their heads.

447
36:56.770 --> 36:59.400
You must pay attention to battlefield discipline.

448
36:59.400 --> 37:02.360
I want you to lead the troops

449
37:03.230 --> 37:04.510
to take Zunyi City

450
37:06.250 --> 37:07.960
and avenge the Chief of Staff.

451
37:23.690 --> 37:24.540
Wait...

452
38:26.510 --> 38:27.390
Let's eat.

453
38:33.330 --> 38:34.170
Eat.

454
39:11.280 --> 39:13.880
Deng Ping was born in 1908

455
39:13.880 --> 39:15.960
in Fushun County, Sichuan Province.

456
39:16.230 --> 39:18.830
He joined the Communist Party of China in 1927.

457
39:19.190 --> 39:21.710
He participated in organizing and leading

458
39:21.710 --> 39:23.230
the Pingjiang Uprising in 1928.

459
39:23.230 --> 39:24.880
He served successively in the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army

460
39:24.880 --> 39:26.550
as Chief of Staff of the 5th Army,

461
39:26.550 --> 39:30.350
Chief of Staff of the 3rd Red Army Corps and Commander of the 5th Army.

462
39:30.670 --> 39:33.070
On February 27, 1935,

463
39:33.320 --> 39:35.150
during the battle in the old city of Zunyi,

464
39:35.150 --> 39:37.050
he was hit in the head by a stray bullet

465
39:37.050 --> 39:38.260
and died heroically

466
39:38.440 --> 39:40.110
at the age of 27.

467
39:40.590 --> 39:43.110
Deng Ping was the highest-ranking commander

468
39:43.110 --> 39:44.880
who fell during the Long March.

469
39:49.000 --> 39:51.960
On the morning of February 28, 1935,

470
39:52.590 --> 39:55.400
a part of the 59th Division of the Kuomintang Central Army

471
39:55.400 --> 39:58.650
took the lead in launching a fierce attack on Honghuagang,

472
39:58.650 --> 40:01.850
but was repelled multiple times by the 11th Red Regiment.

473
40:03.310 --> 40:05.150
Wu Qiwei made a desperate move,

474
40:05.320 --> 40:06.830
concentrating all his forces

475
40:06.830 --> 40:09.210
under the cover of aircraft and artillery,

476
40:09.210 --> 40:12.470
and turned to fiercely attack the Laoyashan defense line.

477
40:13.110 --> 40:15.670
The Red 10th Regiment defending the Laoyashan position

478
40:15.670 --> 40:18.840
fought a bloody battle with enemy forces several times their size.

479
40:18.840 --> 40:20.480
They suffered heavy casualties,

480
40:20.480 --> 40:22.940
and the position changed hands at one point.

481
40:23.230 --> 40:24.560
At the critical moment,

482
40:24.630 --> 40:27.230
the Military Commission Cadre Regiment arrived as reinforcements.

483
40:27.230 --> 40:29.440
The Red Army finally

484
40:29.670 --> 40:31.800
reconsolidated the position at dusk.

485
40:34.160 --> 40:41.630
[Command Post of the 1st Red Army Corps, Liangshuijing, Guizhou]

486
40:40.230 --> 40:44.360
An urgent telegram from the Central Revolutionary Military Commission.

487
40:50.430 --> 40:51.840
The Central Revolutionary Military Commission ordered us

488
40:51.840 --> 40:53.400
to outflank and attack Zhongzhuangpu,

489
40:53.400 --> 40:55.760
and prepare to pursue the enemy southward.

490
40:55.760 --> 40:58.020
The battle south of Zunyi is almost over.

491
40:58.670 --> 41:00.110
Except for the 3rd Regiment, which is assisting

492
41:00.110 --> 41:01.550
the 3rd Red Army Corps,

493
41:01.710 --> 41:03.610
all other Regiments can be sent to the front.

494
41:03.500 --> 41:05.970
[Nie Rongzhen, Political Commissar of the 1st Red Army Corps]

495
41:04.000 --> 41:05.010
Why send

496
41:05.400 --> 41:06.110
so many people?

497
41:06.110 --> 41:07.510
[Zuo Quan, Chief of Staff of the 1st Red Army Corps]

498
41:07.150 --> 41:08.550
Zhongzhuangpu is empty.

499
41:09.190 --> 41:10.880
Sending the 2nd Red Division is enough.

500
41:10.880 --> 41:11.480
Order:

501
41:11.710 --> 41:13.190
Tell Chen Guang and Liu Yalou

502
41:13.190 --> 41:14.660
to ignore the enemy troops along the way.

503
41:14.660 --> 41:16.610
Keep a close eye on Wu Qiwei's headquarters.

504
41:16.430 --> 41:17.850
[Lin Biao, Commander of the 1st Red Army Corps]

505
41:16.850 --> 41:18.080
Crush it first.

506
41:18.220 --> 41:18.860
Yes.

507
41:28.440 --> 41:29.920
Vanguard, speed up!

508
41:30.480 --> 41:31.880
You in the rear, close up!

509
41:32.190 --> 41:33.590
You in the rear, close up!

510
41:35.000 --> 41:36.400
You in the rear, close up!

511
41:38.940 --> 41:40.470
[Mao Zhenhua, Company Commander of the 3rd Company, 1st Battalion, 4th Regiment]

512
41:39.800 --> 41:41.060
Political Commissar!

513
41:46.030 --> 41:47.290
Political Commissar.

514
41:48.040 --> 41:50.000
We didn't fight at Loushanguan,

515
41:50.520 --> 41:52.520
and now we're not fighting at Zunyi.

516
41:52.750 --> 41:53.680
What's going on?

517
41:54.000 --> 41:56.150
Has our 1st Corps become a running team?

518
41:56.150 --> 41:57.950
Why are you complaining so much?

519
41:59.070 --> 42:01.710
Our mission is to outflank and annihilate the enemy.

520
42:01.710 --> 42:03.800
Is this your first day fighting a mobile war?

521
42:03.800 --> 42:04.960
Not really.

522
42:05.400 --> 42:07.230
But we can't keep running like this forever.

523
42:07.230 --> 42:08.960
I, Mao Zhenhua, have no place

524
42:09.090 --> 42:10.400
to use my skills.

525
42:11.440 --> 42:13.640
Company Commanders, gather around me!

526
42:24.230 --> 42:25.000
Are you tired?

527
42:25.000 --> 42:25.840
No.

528
42:26.510 --> 42:28.230
I heard you all like competitions.

529
42:28.230 --> 42:29.430
Let's have one today.

530
42:30.150 --> 42:31.880
This is a pursuit and annihilation battle.

531
42:31.880 --> 42:34.140
Whichever company captures the highest-ranking prisoner,

532
42:34.140 --> 42:35.850
[Huang Kaixiang, Commander of the 4th Red Regiment]

533
42:34.490 --> 42:35.550
I will reward them.

534
42:35.590 --> 42:36.230
There are prizes.

535
42:36.230 --> 42:37.630
-What's the prize? -What's the prize?

536
42:37.630 --> 42:38.630
A Mauser pistol

537
42:39.000 --> 42:40.140
and 50 rounds of pointed bullets.

538
42:40.140 --> 42:41.040
Is this prize okay?

539
42:41.040 --> 42:41.920
Yes!

540
42:41.950 --> 42:43.470
Regiment Commander, I have a request.

541
42:43.470 --> 42:44.280
Speak.

542
42:45.400 --> 42:46.710
I don't care about others.

543
42:46.710 --> 42:48.760
If I, Mao Zhenhua, capture the highest-ranking one,

544
42:48.760 --> 42:50.760
could you award me this revolver?

545
42:59.170 --> 43:00.330
Forget it if you can't bear to part with it.
